From b0f82aec117de958a0b2023b17b30c1f7f026fc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev Contributor <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:46:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] finiteness_checker: add helpers to count non-finite values

Adds a DAAL-side countNotFinite/countNotFiniteInBlocks pair and a oneAPI-side
count_non_finite_rows helper backed by a small header-only scanning utility.
These will be used to report how many non-finite values were found.
---
